    <informations>Shelly Dimmer Gen3 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: L L N O O S2 S1.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-dimmer-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_a85f4835bf4d08b628b9ca72c363eee85ff773b4c85ab9d6c72806f46d471951/Shelly%20Dimmer%20Gen3.jpg?cb=db059eb97bef492bc9044757a47a2096
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_8ab90e5d2638830b128d17c546983a44c3d8fdc4cdba51f4338b009e0159d93c/Dimmer-Gen3-internal-schematics.png?cb=fc25336a974b8532f01248ceb6d8f54f
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_c4a66e166dc9d8714159e211117292c0292afcb9a2d346009178713d0b34c0c6/Shelly%20Dimmer%20Gen3%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=c612ecff3f8ac692b601e43854104a66

Notes:
- Seven actual screws. Two L and two O terminals are grouped under shared labels in product photo.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
